267
00:18:11,160 --> 00:18:13,860
You're pretty good for a human.

268
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:15,520
Who are you exactly?

269
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:17,600
You guys okay?

270
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,100
Chinoa? Fine.

271
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:25,160
Yuichiro and Kimizuki should take points since they're the strongest one-on-one fighters.

272
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:28,500
The rest of us will cover them and tag in if things start to look rough.

273
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:30,820
We can't underestimate this guy's abilities.

274
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:43,180
This is bad. Things just took a turn for the worse.

275
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:45,540
What now? Do we retreat?

276
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:50,720
Getting out of here would be the best idea, but I doubt these three will let us do that.

277
00:18:51,580 --> 00:18:56,220
So we fight at full power. We let the demons almost completely possess us.

278
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,980
But that still might not be enough.

279
00:18:59,600 --> 00:19:04,560
We might not survive, but we are soldiers. We knew that from the start.

280
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:10,580
Okay, fine. If that's how it's gonna be, just know that I'm not gonna let any of you die.

281
00:19:11,420 --> 00:19:13,900
That's the whole reason I fought for so much power.

282
00:19:13,900 --> 00:19:16,060
Right, Ashram Maru?

283
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:20,580
Um, Lord Crowley? What are you doing wasting your time with these humans?

284
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:23,940
The seventh progenitor is waiting for you at the front line.

285
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:24,820
Hmm?

286
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:27,200
Ferret wants to see me.

287
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:29,940
I probably shouldn't keep him waiting.

288
00:19:30,660 --> 00:19:34,040
Pity. Things were just starting to get interesting here.

289
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:39,040
Very well. I suppose this can wait until later.

290
00:19:40,060 --> 00:19:42,080
I'll let all of you go for today.

291
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:45,660
But next time we meet, I'm draining every last drop of your blood.

292
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:46,800
What?

293
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:52,560
So long for now, my cute little blood bag.

294
00:19:52,560 --> 00:20:07,520
We're... okay. We don't have to fight.

295
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:10,780
That arrogant jerk.

296
00:20:12,100 --> 00:20:13,180
What a bastard!

297
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:15,920
Treating us as if we were his playthings!

298
00:20:16,560 --> 00:20:17,660
Pull yourself together.

299
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:20,760
We need to get out of here before they start having second thoughts.

300
00:20:21,180 --> 00:20:22,800
Let's meet up with the Shinjuku units.

301
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:24,460
Damn it!

302
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:25,720
This is all wrong!

303
00:20:26,180 --> 00:20:27,400
I've got a cursed gear.

304
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:29,300
I'm supposed to be as strong as he is!

305
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:34,420
Well, since you've got the Black Demon series, you could always learn some curses.

306
00:20:35,040 --> 00:20:37,120
That'd help get you closer to his power level.

307
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,140
Then why haven't you taught me any?

308
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:40,360
Well, I could.

309
00:20:40,620 --> 00:20:44,060
But what good is it if you're the only one who can defeat a powerful vampire?

310
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:47,060
I'd probably be killed while you fought.

311
00:20:47,540 --> 00:20:48,020
Yoichi.

312
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:49,200
Mitsuba.

313
00:20:50,260 --> 00:20:51,960
They'd just end up dying, too.

314
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:54,060
That's why we have to work together.

315
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:58,000
All of us have to keep training so that we fight as a unit of equals.

316
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:00,000
We're improving.

317
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:02,720
I was happy to hear you ask about retreating.

318
00:21:03,380 --> 00:21:05,000
And there's something else I have to say.

319
00:21:07,580 --> 00:21:09,720
Thank you for saving my life earlier, Yun.

320
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:12,200
It's like Lieutenant Colonel Gurren said.

321
00:21:12,520 --> 00:21:13,840
You care about your friends.

322
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:14,300
Huh?

323
00:21:14,980 --> 00:21:16,240
Oh, it was nothing.

324
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:28,820
You know, I'm kind of ready to go back to Shibuya.

325
00:21:28,820 --> 00:21:29,780
I hear you.

326
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:31,620
But right now it's not an option.

327
00:21:32,060 --> 00:21:34,360
If Shinjuku falls, then Shibuya's next.

328
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:35,940
Your sister's there.

329
00:21:36,380 --> 00:21:37,580
Remember that when we fight.

330
00:21:38,180 --> 00:21:39,100
Let's get moving.

331
00:21:40,740 --> 00:21:42,140
We won't lose Shinjuku.

332
00:21:42,860 --> 00:21:43,320
Right.

333
00:21:43,320 --> 00:21:44,180
How did you own a night?

334
00:21:44,180 --> 00:22:14,160
Thank you.

335
00:22:14,180 --> 00:22:44,160
Thank you.

336
00:22:44,180 --> 00:23:14,160
Thank you.

